@startuml Trade_Store_Class_Diagram
title Trade Store - Application Component and Class Diagram

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "API Layer" {
    class FastAPIApplication {
        +create_trade()
        +get_all_trades()
        +get_trade()
        +health_check()
        +lifespan()
    }

    class KafkaRouter {
        +create_trade_via_kafka(trade_data)
    }

    class TradeCreate {
        +trade_id: str
        +version: int
        +counterparty_id: str
        +portfolio_id: str
        +maturity_date: date
        +created_date: date
    }

    class TradeResponse {
        +trade_id: str
        +version: int
        +counterparty_id: str
        +portfolio_id: str
        +maturity_date: date
        +created_date: date
        +expired: bool
    }
}

package "Business Layer" {
    class TradeService {
        +save_trade(db, trade_data)
    }

    class ExpiryService {
        +expire_matured_trades()
    }
}

package "Kafka Ingestion Layer" {
    class KafkaProducer {
        +get_producer()
        +publish_trade(trade)
        +start_producer_polling()
        +stop_producer_polling()
    }

    class KafkaConsumer {
        +run_consumer()
        +process_message(message)
        +publish_rejection(message, error)
        +stop_consumer(signum, frame)
    }

    class ConsumerLauncher {
        +main()
    }

    queue "trades.incoming" as IncomingTopic
    queue "trades.rejected" as DLQ
}

package "Persistence Layer" {
    class Trade {
        +trade_id: str
        +version: int
        +counterparty_id: str
        +portfolio_id: str
        +maturity_date: date
        +created_date: date
        +expired: bool
    }

    class Database {
        +engine
        +SessionLocal
        +get_db()
    }

    database PostgreSQL
}

class BackgroundScheduler {
    +start()
    +shutdown()
    +add_job()
}

FastAPIApplication ..> TradeCreate : validates
FastAPIApplication ..> TradeResponse : returns
FastAPIApplication --> TradeService : REST ingestion
FastAPIApplication --> KafkaRouter : includes router
FastAPIApplication --> ExpiryService : startup catch-up

KafkaRouter ..> TradeCreate : validates
KafkaRouter --> KafkaProducer : publishes
KafkaProducer --> IncomingTopic : produces
IncomingTopic --> KafkaConsumer : consumes
ConsumerLauncher --> KafkaConsumer : starts 1-6 processes

KafkaConsumer --> TradeService : saves valid trades
KafkaConsumer --> DLQ : publishes rejections

TradeService --> Trade : creates / updates
TradeService --> Database : uses session
KafkaConsumer --> Database : opens session
ExpiryService --> Database : uses session
Database --> PostgreSQL : persists

BackgroundScheduler --> ExpiryService : daily 00:01 IST

note right of KafkaProducer
  Shared producer instance
  Background polling thread
  Delivery acknowledgment
  acks=all
  Idempotence enabled
end note

note right of KafkaConsumer
  Consumer group:
  trade-store-consumers

  Manual offset commits
  Retry on database failure
  DLQ for invalid trades
end note

note bottom of IncomingTopic
  6 partitions in local setup
end note

@enduml
